# Secrets. A committed FLASK_SECRET_KEY is a full auth bypass — anyone with
# repo access could forge a session cookie for any user. Real values live in
# the shell env (local) or the systemd/gunicorn unit's Environment= (server);
# .env is only a local convenience and must never be committed.
